WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.562
Let’s walk through Received Proposals.

00:00:02.562 --> 00:00:05.325
Confirm that the proposal was forwarded to this team,

00:00:05.325 --> 00:00:08.938
then read its terms and recipient-specific history in full.

00:00:08.938 --> 00:00:11.950
Interpret the current recipient state from the thread rather than

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:14.250
from proposal visibility alone.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.325
On this slide, acknowledge, decline, ignore,

00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:20.538
or answer proposals White Cell forwarded to the team.

00:00:20.538 --> 00:00:23.675
In practice, read the proposal and its thread before

00:00:23.675 --> 00:00:25.475
recording the team’s position;

00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:28.837
negotiation remains attached to the recipient record.

00:00:29.335 --> 00:00:32.410
When you are ready, use Open Received Proposals to

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:34.248
move to the live surface.

00:00:34.248 --> 00:00:36.985
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:36.985 --> 00:00:37.135
.
